        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "No water, no life. No blue, no green. Oceans give us food and medicine. They help to clean the water we drink. They also help "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "regulate",
            "zh": "调节"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "climate",
            "ref": "v-climate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We need healthy oceans."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "June 8th is World Oceans Day! Who doesn’t enjoy a day at the beach? But what about swimming in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trash",
            "zh": "垃圾"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? That sounds really bad. Do you know that our oceans are facing many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "risks",
            "ref": "v-risk"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "overfishing",
            "zh": "过度捕捞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", climate change and plastic "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pollution",
            "ref": "v-pollution"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Luckily, you can help! And here’s what you can do:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "Reduce",
              "ref": "v-reduce"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " your trash: "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "Reuse",
              "zh": "再次使用"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ", "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "donate",
              "zh": "捐赠"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " or recycle your unwanted things. Don’t just throw them away."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "vocab",
              "v": "Respect",
              "ref": "v-respect"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " the beach: Always clean up after yourself. You can also take part in a beach clean-up."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Take a better bag: When you go shopping, take a "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "reusable",
              "zh": "可重复使用的"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " bag "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "instead of",
              "zh": "代替"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " plastic ones."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Jump in: Ask your parents to take you to a World Oceans Day event."
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "“Wear blue, tell two”: Wear blue and tell others two facts about why oceans are important and how they can help."
            }
          ]
        ]
